@* A trail of steps. CurrentStep is zero-based; the active one is filled, the ones before it
   are done. Pure markup and CSS — nothing here needs a script. *@
@* The scroller is the page's, not the component's: a horizontal trail is wider than a phone, and
   an app chooses between scrolling it and Orientation="Vertical". *@
<div class="w-full overflow-x-auto">
    <Steps CurrentStep="1">
        <StepsItem Title="Account" Description="Create your account" />
        <StepsItem Title="Profile" Description="Set up your profile" />
        <StepsItem Title="Complete" Description="All done" />
    </Steps>
</div>
